{"id": "99210117", "name": "צפיפות Ct^(−γ) על t≥1 (פרטו) – הקבוע, התוחלת והסתברות בחזרות", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>למשתנה המקרי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(X\\)</span> פונקציית הצפיפות<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ f(t)=\\begin{cases}C\\,t^{-{{CT:0}}}, & t\\ge 1\\\\ 0, & t\\lt 1\\end{cases} \\]</p>כאשר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(C\\)</span> קבוע.</p><p style=\"margin-top:12px\">א. מצאו את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(C\\)</span>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p style=\"margin-top:12px\">ב. חשבו את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{E}[X]\\)</span>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]]</div><p style=\"margin-top:12px\">ג. מודדים את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(X\\)</span> שוב ושוב <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:1}}\\)</span> פעמים (מדידות בלתי תלויות). מה ההסתברות שלפחות באחת המדידות התקבל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(X>{{CT:1}}\\)</span>?</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans3]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans3]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> נרמול ותוחלת – אינטגרלים לא אמיתיים; בסעיף ג – זנב ההתפלגות ומשלים במדידות בלתי תלויות.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — הקבוע</b><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\int_1^\\infty C\\,t^{-{{CT:0}}}dt=\\frac{C}{ {{CT:2}} }=1\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad C={{CT:3}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — התוחלת</b><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\mathbb{E}[X]=\\int_1^\\infty t\\cdot {{CT:3}}\\,t^{-{{CT:0}}}dt={{CT:3}}\\int_1^\\infty t^{-{{CT:2}}}dt=\\frac{ {{CT:3}} }{ {{CT:4}} }={{CT:5}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 3 — בחזרות</b><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\mathbb{P}(X>{{CT:1}})=\\int_{ {{CT:1}} }^\\infty {{CT:3}}\\,t^{-{{CT:0}}}dt={{CT:1}}^{-{{CT:2}}}={{CT:6}} \\]</p>המשלים: בכל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:1}}\\)</span> המדידות <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(X\\le {{CT:1}}\\)</span>. לכן<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\mathbb{P}=1-\\left(1-{{CT:6}}\\right)^{ {{CT:1}} }={{CT:7}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]][[feedback:prt2]][[feedback:prt3]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 80, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "t1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}, {"name": "prt2", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "t2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}, {"name": "prt3", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans3", "tans": "t3", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt3-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt3-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans3", "tans": "if NN*pN=t3 then -1 else NN*pN", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt3-2-T", "feedback": "<p>זה חסם האיחוד (סכום ההסתברויות), ולא ההסתברות עצמה. עברו למשלים: בכל המדידות \\(X\\le N\\).</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt3-2-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["NN", "gg", "pN", "t1", "t2", "t3"], "nvariants": 36}